        387.5146789550781,
        374.5789489746094,
        406.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "Well she is very cheerful, but she needs a lot of help.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        419.1320495605469,
        105.86299896240234,
        438.6334533691406
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        439.23468017578125,
        398.9031677246094,
        458.0335998535156
      ],
      "text": "Have you tried to get any support from the local council?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        470.85205078125,
        128.062255859375,
        490.35345458984375
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        490.95367431640625,
        216.7790985107422,
        509.7525939941406
      ],
      "text": "No, I didn't know I could.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        522.571044921875,
        105.86299896240234,
        542.0724487304688
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        542.6747436523438,
        503.6895751953125,
        601.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Yes, they offer different kinds of practical support. They realise that carers\nsometimes need time for all the other responsibilities they have, apart from\nthe person they're caring for, and also that they sometimes need a break.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        614.1320190429688,
        128.062255859375,
        633.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        634.11474609375,
        486.6224670410156,
        652.9136352539062
      ],
      "text": "Absolutely. OK, so tell me more. How do I go about getting this support?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        665.85205078125,
        105.86299896240234,
        685.3534545898438
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        685.834716796875,
        516.295166015625,
        764.2736206054688
      ],
      "text": "Well, you'd have to have an assessment of your mother's needs. That means\nsomeone would come round and talk to you about the situation and what you\nneed. So, for a start, they'd want to know the amount of time you spend\nlooking after your mother every day.\n"
    }
  ]
}